WEBVTT

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:12.990
Saint Seiya

00:01:41.970 --> 00:01:43.800
Saga, Shura, Camus!

00:01:45.820 --> 00:01:48.810
Why do you have on Cube
and the other's Surplices?

00:01:49.150 --> 00:01:50.400
Did you guys...

00:01:54.860 --> 00:01:59.880
Were you just pretending to
pledge yourselves to Lord Hades?

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:13.020
My body won't move!

00:02:13.660 --> 00:02:18.940
Shaka is no opponent for
all of you, even together.

00:02:19.330 --> 00:02:21.620
If you value your lives, stay back.

00:02:22.040 --> 00:02:23.160
What?

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:31.210
If you want Athena's head, leave it to us.

00:02:43.410 --> 00:02:46.970
The End of Restraint

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:52.220
Saga, do you mean what you just said?

00:02:52.430 --> 00:02:55.840
Do you really intend to take Athena's head?

00:02:55.850 --> 00:02:56.730
I'll take it.

00:02:56.880 --> 00:02:57.800
Honestly?

00:02:58.280 --> 00:02:59.220
Enough.

00:03:24.330 --> 00:03:26.900
I see. I understand.

00:03:26.960 --> 00:03:31.710
Your minds are set on taking Athena's head.

00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:35.080
Servants of Hades, you may go.

00:03:36.300 --> 00:03:40.330
Even I can't take on three

00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:45.910
Gold Saints at once.

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:49.070
Then we shall pass.

00:03:58.640 --> 00:04:01.460
This guy's a joke. He let them pass.

00:04:01.460 --> 00:04:04.250
I can't believe he's the man closest to God.

00:04:04.250 --> 00:04:07.840
Even Gold Saints value life.

00:04:07.840 --> 00:04:10.550
Let's don't mind him and go ahead too.

00:04:10.550 --> 00:04:14.090
We Specters can't waste
time with a coward either.

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:16.500
Have you already forgotten?

00:04:18.050 --> 00:04:19.060
About what?

00:04:19.410 --> 00:04:24.320
Saga told you to stay back
if you wanted to live.

00:04:26.090 --> 00:04:29.980
Look, your beads have turned color also.

00:04:29.980 --> 00:04:35.020
Fool, running your mouth when we just
saved your life. It doesn't matter!

00:04:35.020 --> 00:04:36.370
Rip him to pieces!

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:45.940
I won't let you tarnish the
Sanctuary with your filth.

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:49.520
Vanish, scum! Demon Pacifier!

00:04:59.120 --> 00:05:01.560
Are you afraid of death?

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:06.590
Death doesn't scare those under Lord Hades.

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:09.660
We have been promised
eternal life after death.

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:11.500
Is that so?

00:05:12.300 --> 00:05:17.870
But I have discussed with Buddha since birth.

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:23.910
I have never heard of anyone who
has been given eternal life.

00:05:24.210 --> 00:05:31.880
Perhaps I'm not enlightened, or...

00:05:32.230 --> 00:05:33.590
Could it be?

00:05:34.450 --> 00:05:37.210
That means what Lord Hades told us...

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:44.850
Wait.

00:05:46.970 --> 00:05:51.840
As you see, I've taken care of all the scum.

00:05:52.140 --> 00:05:54.690
Now, tell me the truth.

00:05:55.690 --> 00:05:56.830
Truth?

00:05:57.140 --> 00:06:02.690
That's right. The truth you
couldn't speak with them around.

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:04.870
Then I'll tell you.

00:06:07.860 --> 00:06:10.050
It's to take Athena's life.

00:06:10.880 --> 00:06:12.010
I see.

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:18.720
Men of your caliber wouldn't submit to Hades.

00:06:18.950 --> 00:06:24.340
I knew there was something there.

00:06:25.510 --> 00:06:30.780
Now, I will defeat you with my life!

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:40.790
Soaking the Virgo house in anymore
blood is disrespectful to Athena.

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:43.720
The three of you follow me.

00:06:44.160 --> 00:06:45.200
Where are you going?

00:06:48.560 --> 00:06:50.170
The final resting place.

00:07:05.840 --> 00:07:11.110
I didn't know there was such
a garden in the Virgo house.

00:07:12.920 --> 00:07:13.950
This is the first time I've seen it.

00:07:14.480 --> 00:07:16.590
What is this garden?

00:07:17.820 --> 00:07:23.400
I see. This is the rumored Sala garden.

00:07:24.110 --> 00:07:25.960
Sala garden?

00:07:28.850 --> 00:07:31.720
Shaka is said to be the
reincarnate of Buddha.

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:37.560
And that Buddha died

00:07:37.760 --> 00:07:40.100
under the tree in the Sala garden.

00:07:42.110 --> 00:07:46.100
Shaka is ready to be killed by us three.

00:07:52.390 --> 00:07:53.710
Fine.

00:07:53.720 --> 00:08:00.120
We'll bury him in his final resting place.

00:08:03.450 --> 00:08:04.990
Die, Shaka.

00:08:08.830 --> 00:08:09.770
Excalibur!

00:08:18.210 --> 00:08:20.180
Diamond Dust!

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:54.340
Another Dimension!

00:09:13.930 --> 00:09:17.950
I can't be thrown into another dimension yet.

00:09:18.640 --> 00:09:23.480
I'll eventually be defeated
up against three Gold Saints.

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:34.130
What's wrong, Shaka?

00:09:34.720 --> 00:09:36.850
Do you forfeit?

00:09:40.940 --> 00:09:42.890
Wait. Stay away from Shaka.

00:09:54.810 --> 00:09:57.300
My ultimate attack!

00:09:57.300 --> 00:09:59.220
Treasures of Heaven!

00:10:09.730 --> 00:10:15.330
As you know, the Treasures of Heaven
is both offensive and defensive.

00:10:16.070 --> 00:10:21.800
Which means you can neither
attack nor retreat.

00:10:22.190 --> 00:10:25.810
We can neither attack nor retreat?

00:10:26.570 --> 00:10:31.260
Have we stepped into Shaka's trap?

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:34.240
At this rate.

00:10:37.100 --> 00:10:41.930
That's right. At this rate victory
is not an option for you.

00:10:42.230 --> 00:10:49.170
There's one way for you to defeat me.

00:10:49.170 --> 00:10:50.190
Just one.

00:10:52.370 --> 00:10:53.200
What?

00:10:53.520 --> 00:10:57.210
That's right. During the ancient times.

00:10:57.650 --> 00:11:03.150
The Gold Saint shadow technique
forbidden by Athena.

00:11:05.860 --> 00:11:08.940
Athena Exclamation.

00:11:15.160 --> 00:11:17.760
Athena Exclamation?

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:24.260
The shadow technique forbidden by Athena.

00:11:28.610 --> 00:11:34.220
You're Hades' warriors,
what are you worried about?

00:11:34.300 --> 00:11:41.340
It's your choice whether you use it or
not. But I will demolish your five senses.

00:11:44.360 --> 00:11:46.690
Destroying the first sense.

00:12:08.260 --> 00:12:11.620
Shaka, then as you seek.

00:12:16.110 --> 00:12:19.410
We'll give you the Athena Exclamation.

00:12:19.940 --> 00:12:23.280
Wait, Saga, the Athena Exclamation.

00:12:23.280 --> 00:12:28.250
If we use that, even if we win...

00:12:28.930 --> 00:12:32.010
We'll no longer...

00:12:32.510 --> 00:12:36.950
Camus, Shura, you must already know.

00:12:37.590 --> 00:12:40.470
Since entering the Sala garden,

00:12:40.540 --> 00:12:45.640
Shaka doesn't seek to win but to die.

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:51.550
He's ready to die under the twin Sala trees.

00:12:53.530 --> 00:12:57.570
This attack unleashed by three Gold Saints.

00:12:57.730 --> 00:13:02.070
The maximized Cosmo will focus on one point.

00:13:02.930 --> 00:13:09.580
It's force is comparable to the Big Bang.

00:13:10.400 --> 00:13:14.900
It's destructive force drove Athena

00:13:14.900 --> 00:13:20.080
to forbid this shadow technique.

00:13:20.710 --> 00:13:25.120
The ultimate attack, Athena Exclamation.

00:13:28.270 --> 00:13:32.870
We will unleash the Athena
exclamation and defeat Shaka.

00:13:33.130 --> 00:13:34.870
But that means...

00:13:35.260 --> 00:13:39.800
A Saint who uses the Athena
Exclamation will never...

00:13:41.140 --> 00:13:43.550
Destroying the second sense.

00:13:53.620 --> 00:13:57.560
Athena's Saints fight is
the fight for justice.

00:13:57.690 --> 00:14:04.250
Fairness is mandatory and
Athena even despises weapons.

00:14:06.160 --> 00:14:13.860
Three Gold Saints unleash the Athena
Exclamation to defeat one opponent.

00:14:13.860 --> 00:14:19.500
It isn't fit for the battle for
justice, thus Athena forbade it.

00:14:22.910 --> 00:14:24.970
Do you know, Saga?

00:14:26.120 --> 00:14:33.800
If we use the Athena Exclamation
that Athena deemed dishonorable.

00:14:33.980 --> 00:14:40.510
We will be stripped of our Sainthood.

00:14:40.860 --> 00:14:45.910
We will forever be disgraced in death.

00:14:50.080 --> 00:14:53.010
Destroying the third sense.

00:14:54.480 --> 00:14:56.430
Have you two forgotten?

00:14:56.890 --> 00:15:03.310
The reason we even pledged to Hades
to come to the twelve houses.

00:15:03.830 --> 00:15:05.700
Whatever happens.

00:15:05.700 --> 00:15:09.500
We must get to Athena.

00:15:10.430 --> 00:15:15.940
To accomplish this, we should
gladly shed our Sainthood.

00:15:17.290 --> 00:15:23.300
You're right. Sight, sound, smell, taste.

00:15:23.300 --> 00:15:29.000
Touch. Even if we lose our five
senses, we can't lose to Shaka.

00:15:29.160 --> 00:15:35.080
We've already died once.
Being labeled a disgrace.

00:15:35.640 --> 00:15:38.120
Is a label we will gladly accept.

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:40.240
For Athena's sake.

00:15:41.490 --> 00:15:45.020
For the sake of love and
justice of the world.

00:15:46.370 --> 00:15:48.820
Destroying the fourth sense.

00:15:53.640 --> 00:15:54.750
Shaka.

00:15:55.150 --> 00:15:56.760
What's this feeling?

00:16:01.190 --> 00:16:03.310
Are you trying to die, Shaka?

00:16:23.670 --> 00:16:24.930
Someone's here.

00:16:32.920 --> 00:16:36.290
Mu, have you come to help Shaka too?

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:40.210
I feel Shaka's tremendous Cosmo.

00:16:40.610 --> 00:16:42.470
It's on the other side of the door.

00:16:43.830 --> 00:16:45.210
Let's hurry up.

00:16:47.350 --> 00:16:53.400
We are not to enter the Sala
garden beyond this door.

00:16:53.500 --> 00:16:54.940
What are you saying?

00:16:56.560 --> 00:16:59.230
Are you going to let Shaka die?

00:17:03.440 --> 00:17:06.360
Mu, you must feel it too.

00:17:06.810 --> 00:17:11.170
Saga and the others are ready
to sacrifice everything.

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:14.560
They've even shed their pride as Saints.

00:17:14.790 --> 00:17:18.140
They're trying to kill Shaka
with their forces combined.

00:17:22.040 --> 00:17:26.560
Aioria, do you not understand?

00:17:30.470 --> 00:17:34.270
It is what Shaka seeks.

00:17:36.350 --> 00:17:39.290
Shaka. Shaka.

00:17:40.570 --> 00:17:42.700
Why are you sad?

00:17:43.150 --> 00:17:50.400
You're only six years old yet
you are filled with melancholy.

00:17:51.240 --> 00:17:56.470
Today I saw corpses float
down the Ganges River again.

00:17:57.230 --> 00:18:02.680
By the shore, pilgrims from all over
India were cleansing themselves.

00:18:03.520 --> 00:18:09.670
To me it looked like they were
celebrating death, not life.

00:18:11.340 --> 00:18:15.940
Why is the country of my birth so poor?

00:18:16.650 --> 00:18:23.090
Aren't people born into this world
to taste suffering and sadness?

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:27.580
Shaka, is that sad to you?

00:18:28.190 --> 00:18:33.100
Obviously. Who seeks a life of suffering?

00:18:33.260 --> 00:18:34.660
That's wrong.

00:18:35.870 --> 00:18:39.620
If there is suffering, there is joy.

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:42.500
And vice versa.

00:18:43.620 --> 00:18:47.400
A beautiful flower blooms and then wilts.

00:18:48.160 --> 00:18:52.600
Everything with life is never still.

00:18:53.790 --> 00:19:00.880
Always moving and changing. Everything
is always changing. People are the same.

00:19:01.220 --> 00:19:05.200
But if death is inevitable,

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:09.250
sadness predominates life.

00:19:09.900 --> 00:19:16.220
Even if one seeks love and
joy to overcome suffering,

00:19:16.690 --> 00:19:19.820
ultimately, death will void everything.

00:19:20.770 --> 00:19:24.620
Then why are humans born?

00:19:25.420 --> 00:19:30.340
There's no way to defy the
inevitable, absoluteness of death.

00:19:30.580 --> 00:19:33.830
Shaka, you have forgotten.

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:35.470
Forgotten?

00:19:35.780 --> 00:19:36.980
That is...

00:19:44.230 --> 00:19:45.570
That is...

00:19:51.730 --> 00:19:56.290
Shaka, we will give you what you seek.

00:19:58.060 --> 00:20:00.360
The Athena Exclamation.

00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:14.460
So you finally realized. But
you're a little too late.

00:20:14.980 --> 00:20:19.180
One more blow and your
five senses will be gone.

00:20:23.250 --> 00:20:26.690
Unless you kill me before
I thrust these beads.

00:20:26.690 --> 00:20:31.070
You will be completely destroyed.
Come at me with everything!

00:20:32.320 --> 00:20:33.800
We know.

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:37.590
Go to hell.

00:20:37.910 --> 00:20:41.770
Shaka, we won't let your death be in vain.

00:20:46.430 --> 00:20:49.560
Athena Exclamation!

00:20:57.210 --> 00:20:59.020
Destroying the fifth sense!

00:21:02.940 --> 00:21:06.990
The flower of the Sala trees have fallen.

00:21:08.970 --> 00:21:12.690
Shaka, you have forgotten.

00:21:13.590 --> 00:21:15.190
Forgotten?

00:21:15.910 --> 00:21:18.320
Death is not the end.

00:21:19.140 --> 00:21:23.040
Death is just another transformation.

00:21:31.710 --> 00:21:32.930
Shaka!

00:21:45.920 --> 00:21:47.220
What?

00:21:50.730 --> 00:21:51.690
Shaka.

00:21:52.790 --> 00:21:54.860
No way.

00:21:55.530 --> 00:21:56.620
It can't be.

00:21:57.100 --> 00:21:59.480
Shaka is dead.

00:22:03.980 --> 00:22:08.160
Virgo Shaka has fallen.

00:23:38.340 --> 00:23:40.770
The Athena Exclamation had
finally been released.

00:23:41.130 --> 00:23:43.230
The heaviness of the crime Saga
committed by breaking the taboo,

00:23:43.580 --> 00:23:47.370
deepens the survivor's resolve to protect
Athena even if it costs them their lives.

00:23:48.230 --> 00:23:50.690
When the clash of anger and
sadness of the Golden Saints,

00:23:50.690 --> 00:23:53.120
leads to the destruction of the Sanctuary.

00:23:53.470 --> 00:23:57.130
Will Athena's love be able to
protect the world from darkness?

00:23:57.530 --> 00:23:59.900
Saint Seiya, "The Golden Clash."

00:24:00.270 --> 00:24:02.800
Do you sense the Cosmo?
